Create a warmer, calmer indoor atmosphere with this decorative candle warmer lamp. Designed with a ribbed glass shade, curved metal arm, and wood-style round base, it works as both a candle warming lamp and a stylish home decor accent. Place a compatible jar candle under the shade, use the smart in-line switch to choose the brightness level, and select a 2H, 4H, or 8H timer for more convenient everyday use. The top-down warming design helps release candle fragrance without lighting the wick, making it a useful alternative for bedrooms, living rooms, offices, reading corners, bathrooms, and apartments. Its vintage-inspired look pairs well with modern, cozy, farmhouse, and INS-style interiors, while the compact tabletop structure makes it easy to place on a nightstand, desk, shelf, or coffee table. It is also a thoughtful gift choice for candle lovers and home fragrance fans.
